
# Little Meadow Farm - Game Design Document

## Game Overview

A single-player 2D pixel-art farming simulator
set in a peaceful countryside village.

## Technical Specifications

- Language: Python
- Framework: Pygame Community Edition
- Platform: Windows PC
- Perspective: Top-down
- Resolution: 960 x 640
- Tile size: 32 x 32 pixels
- Target frame rate: 60 FPS

## Art Direction

- Cosy countryside environment
- Warm colour palette
- Pixel-art characters
- Seasonal landscapes
- Animated crops and animals

## Starting Player Statistics

- Health: 100
- Energy: 100
- Gold: 100
- Seeds: 10
- Day: 1
- Season: Spring
- Time: 6:00 AM

## Core Gameplay Loop

1. Wake up.
2. Plant seeds.
3. Water crops.
4. Collect resources.
5. Harvest crops.
6. Sell products.
7. Buy seeds and upgrades.
8. Sleep and advance to the next day.

## Initial Crops

- Carrots
